# This folder holds serialised model artifacts (.pkl files).
#
# *.pkl files are excluded from git (see root .gitignore).
# Use DVC or Git LFS if you need to version-control model checkpoints.
#
# Naming convention for checkpoints:
#   readmission_model.pkl          ← current production model
#   readmission_model_v1_<date>.pkl  ← archived checkpoint
#
# IMPORTANT: Never load a .pkl from an untrusted source.
# The model must be retrained and re-serialised whenever sklearn or
# xgboost versions change. See backend/requirements.txt for pinned versions.
